WEBVTT

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:10.010
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.262
-Madam, look at these.
-Selling silk, selling silk!

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:15.015
-You won't find anything cheaper!
-The quality is remarkable.

00:00:19.894 --> 00:00:21.229
Mistress painter.

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:31.322
Welcome, mistress painter.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.326
How was your trip?

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.624
It is a sweltering day.

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:44.044
I am already quite wet.

00:00:46.171 --> 00:00:47.547
Shall we begin then?

00:01:06.858 --> 00:01:07.859
Hmm.

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:56.366
Can you capture all this in the painting?

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:58.785
I am capturing it in lines as soft

00:01:58.868 --> 00:02:01.371
as the supple flesh of a boiled egg.

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:02.622
Take every pain…

00:02:03.331 --> 00:02:05.291
to better capture him than me.

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:08.795
What kind of man is he?

00:02:08.878 --> 00:02:11.714
He was a man
who was blessed below the waist.

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:13.758
As you know, mistress painter,

00:02:13.842 --> 00:02:16.594
such a thing cannot be acquired
through training.

00:02:16.678 --> 00:02:20.098
One is born with it,
as with any other thing.

00:02:20.181 --> 00:02:22.851
He was greatly blessed indeed.

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:26.563
However, there were other blessings
apart from that.

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:27.856
Hmm?

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:30.233
Such as his tongue.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:36.364
The tip was smooth as if wrapped in silk.

00:02:36.447 --> 00:02:38.867
His hands were so strong.

00:02:40.201 --> 00:02:43.163
The mere thought of it
makes my flesh tremble.

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:49.085
You must ensure to capture my expression.

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:51.129
Leave aside these trifling worries.

00:02:51.212 --> 00:02:52.463
Carry on without pause.

00:02:52.547 --> 00:02:54.966
It seems that he is beginning to move.

00:02:56.217 --> 00:02:59.554
My hand is moving on its own,
as though possessed by a spirit.

00:03:13.401 --> 00:03:15.945
Who on earth is this astounding person?

00:03:16.946 --> 00:03:19.782
If he is truly bestowed
with such blessings,

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:22.911
I would like the honor
of meeting him myself.

00:03:22.994 --> 00:03:24.829
Soon that may be difficult.

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:26.539
How so?

00:03:26.623 --> 00:03:30.460
He did me a dishonor,
and I intend to do him the same.

00:03:31.085 --> 00:03:33.171
He meddled with my one and only daughter.

00:03:33.254 --> 00:03:35.048
What a wretched scoundrel.

00:03:36.341 --> 00:03:37.759
Shall I intervene?

00:03:38.426 --> 00:03:42.597
If you wish, I could personally ensure
he gets a stern lesson indeed.

00:03:55.944 --> 00:03:57.320
You must be hurt.

00:03:57.820 --> 00:04:00.406
Since that day,
I haven't sent you any word.

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:03.076
I cannot say that I was not hurt.

00:04:05.119 --> 00:04:08.289
Just know that deceiving you
was not my intention.

00:04:09.624 --> 00:04:12.543
But I found myself
growing fond of you, and…

00:04:17.382 --> 00:04:19.467
I have thought on it a great deal.

00:04:22.136 --> 00:04:24.555
It is a fact that you have told me lies,

00:04:25.431 --> 00:04:27.183
which means I have been betrayed.

00:04:28.017 --> 00:04:30.478
Thus, I cannot simply forgive you at once.

00:04:34.232 --> 00:04:37.694
However, when I heard
my sister-in-law had passed away,

00:04:38.444 --> 00:04:41.197
for some reason,
you immediately came to mind.

00:04:42.532 --> 00:04:45.034
I realized that
I did not want to lose you.

00:04:49.497 --> 00:04:52.292
But the fact remains,

00:04:52.875 --> 00:04:55.086
I cannot commit an unfilial act.

00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:58.131
After my brother passed away,

00:04:59.507 --> 00:05:02.218
my mother has placed
great expectations on me.

00:05:04.929 --> 00:05:06.347
Compared to my brother,

00:05:07.932 --> 00:05:09.058
I am lacking.

00:05:11.436 --> 00:05:13.187
But she believes I can excel,

00:05:14.314 --> 00:05:16.107
so I cannot forsake my mother.

00:05:18.192 --> 00:05:19.485
I apologize.

00:05:20.611 --> 00:05:21.904
You're lying to me.

00:05:24.907 --> 00:05:26.951
You just hate me, it's as simple as that.

00:05:27.035 --> 00:05:28.036
Not at all.

00:05:28.745 --> 00:05:30.038
That is not true.

00:05:31.414 --> 00:05:32.874
I…

00:05:38.212 --> 00:05:39.589
I do not hate you.

00:05:40.465 --> 00:05:41.632
No, my lady, I…

00:05:43.343 --> 00:05:45.928
Your face. What's happened to it?

00:05:47.138 --> 00:05:48.639
Did you fall in the night?

00:05:49.515 --> 00:05:50.600
Oh… I…

00:05:50.683 --> 00:05:52.852
Don't tell me someone has struck you.

00:05:54.812 --> 00:05:56.272
Uh, well…

00:06:16.834 --> 00:06:20.046
Uh, I think that's how it's done,
or so I was taught.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:23.091
My lady…

00:06:25.093 --> 00:06:26.511
W-What were you taught?

00:06:27.512 --> 00:06:29.222
Did… Did you not like it?

00:06:29.305 --> 00:06:30.348
Oh, no!

00:06:35.853 --> 00:06:37.146
I liked it.

00:06:40.525 --> 00:06:44.112
I trust we shall meet again, young master?

00:06:44.195 --> 00:06:45.279
Of course.

00:07:16.686 --> 00:07:18.646
Your name is Eun-sil, is it not?

00:07:18.729 --> 00:07:20.148
Yes, madam.

00:07:21.941 --> 00:07:23.234
Eun-sil.

00:08:05.985 --> 00:08:07.153
Young master.

00:08:14.368 --> 00:08:15.828
I am here.

00:08:16.329 --> 00:08:17.413
Over here.

00:08:26.547 --> 00:08:27.757
Oh, young master.

00:08:28.424 --> 00:08:29.800
Why are you here at this hour?

00:08:33.054 --> 00:08:34.680
These are my lady's garments.

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:37.475
Even if we are to burn them,

00:08:37.558 --> 00:08:41.979
I must wash them all first so my lady
can wear clean clothes as she passes on.

00:08:43.439 --> 00:08:45.816
As for the other things,

00:08:46.526 --> 00:08:48.945
Ganghwa told me
to throw them away at once.

00:08:51.989 --> 00:08:54.450
Hmm. You seem busy.

00:08:56.661 --> 00:08:58.204
We must still carry on.

00:08:59.372 --> 00:09:00.706
Do head back inside.

00:09:50.214 --> 00:09:51.215
Huh.

00:10:24.081 --> 00:10:26.542
You keep your mouth shut. Understood?

00:10:32.965 --> 00:10:33.966
Madam.

00:10:37.428 --> 00:10:38.679
You have done well.

00:11:33.275 --> 00:11:36.320
Would you like to come in
if you're truly so curious?

00:11:36.404 --> 00:11:37.822
Uh… No, madam.

00:11:38.698 --> 00:11:40.533
Good night, my lady.

00:12:17.987 --> 00:12:20.072
Oh. A Catholic symbol.

00:12:26.412 --> 00:12:27.913
Now, take a look at this.

00:12:29.165 --> 00:12:32.126
Her Royal Highness
will be seated here in the middle.

00:12:32.668 --> 00:12:37.173
And over here, the musicians and dancers
will fill the space in front of her.

00:12:37.256 --> 00:12:38.382
My goodness.

00:12:38.466 --> 00:12:40.468
What a wonderful, open view.

00:12:40.551 --> 00:12:43.220
Her Royal Highness will be pleased, huh?

00:12:44.096 --> 00:12:46.849
Yes. I am sure she will.

00:12:46.932 --> 00:12:49.310
The banquet is the real test, of course.

00:12:50.019 --> 00:12:53.481
The very thought of it makes my head ache.

00:12:53.564 --> 00:12:55.316
I do think you exaggerate.

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:58.736
You have shown exceptional talent
during these preparations.

00:12:58.819 --> 00:13:00.112
Hmm. Hmm.

00:13:00.196 --> 00:13:02.239
You even made the trip
to see it in person.

00:13:04.784 --> 00:13:06.702
We just have to convince His Majesty now.

00:13:06.786 --> 00:13:09.121
Then I could be satisfied.

00:13:10.122 --> 00:13:11.248
And yet…

00:13:11.916 --> 00:13:14.001
-Huh?
-It seems rather unlikely

00:13:14.084 --> 00:13:17.338
that such a busy man invited me
for no other reason.

00:13:17.421 --> 00:13:18.422
Oh.

00:13:19.381 --> 00:13:22.885
There's a royal decree as well
intended for you.

00:13:30.768 --> 00:13:31.852
Hmm.

00:13:35.439 --> 00:13:37.149
Uh…

00:13:38.734 --> 00:13:39.735
By the way…

00:13:39.819 --> 00:13:42.112
…there is something
I have always wondered.

00:13:45.282 --> 00:13:47.952
This is not to say
I disregard your talents.

00:13:48.035 --> 00:13:49.161
It's just…

00:13:50.162 --> 00:13:51.705
Uh… I'll say what I mean.

00:13:51.789 --> 00:13:55.543
It is common knowledge that
you are mainly an author of vulgar prose.

00:13:55.626 --> 00:13:58.128
Yet, despite incurring
His Majesty's wrath,

00:13:58.879 --> 00:14:02.800
how is it you are summoned
to the palace so often, hmm?

00:14:08.722 --> 00:14:11.475
How did you manage
to secure a place by his side?

00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:14.228
I have secured nothing for myself.

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:18.399
My place by His Majesty's side

00:14:18.983 --> 00:14:21.026
is a punishment without end.

00:15:23.005 --> 00:15:24.006
Hmm?

00:15:31.096 --> 00:15:32.097
Oh.

00:15:35.726 --> 00:15:36.727
Goodness.

00:16:40.749 --> 00:16:42.251
You have come back.

00:16:59.727 --> 00:17:01.937
Has all gone well with your affairs?

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:09.361
Sorry I'm late.

00:17:11.572 --> 00:17:13.323
I meant to stay awake.

00:17:13.824 --> 00:17:15.075
I apologize.

00:17:18.037 --> 00:17:19.913
I'm sure you were very tired.

00:17:21.373 --> 00:17:22.708
I could hear you snore.

00:17:26.837 --> 00:17:28.881
What do you mean you heard me snore?

00:17:31.133 --> 00:17:32.718
That is impossible.

00:17:33.761 --> 00:17:35.137
There's no shame in it.

00:17:38.515 --> 00:17:42.061
Even if thunder
were to roar from your nose…

00:17:46.648 --> 00:17:50.027
…in my eyes, even Yang Guifei or Xi Shi

00:17:50.736 --> 00:17:52.529
would pale in comparison

00:17:53.489 --> 00:17:55.324
to one as lovely as you.

00:17:55.908 --> 00:17:58.077
There's no need for such jokes.

00:17:58.577 --> 00:18:01.789
I speak not in jest, but in earnest.

00:18:20.849 --> 00:18:22.309
Sleep well, my lady.

00:18:26.814 --> 00:18:29.024
I shall retire to the outer quarters.

00:19:25.455 --> 00:19:27.249
Hardly a face for a lady.

00:19:27.875 --> 00:19:30.752
Oh.

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:37.759
I'm sorry, my lady,

00:19:37.843 --> 00:19:39.803
but can you write it in the proper script?

00:19:40.721 --> 00:19:42.973
Why are you writing in the vernacular?

00:19:43.056 --> 00:19:45.517
I am feigning ignorance,

00:19:46.059 --> 00:19:47.811
lest knowing too well bring trouble.

00:19:47.895 --> 00:19:51.398
Can knowing really bring so much trouble?

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:56.528
This petition is to be submitted
to His Majesty.

00:19:56.612 --> 00:19:58.363
I have written it as I ought.

00:19:58.447 --> 00:19:59.781
To His Majesty?

00:19:59.865 --> 00:20:03.827
The lady of the Left State Councilor's
household has asked me for a favor,

00:20:04.411 --> 00:20:06.371
so I have made a royal petition.

00:20:06.455 --> 00:20:09.166
Most admirable.

00:20:09.249 --> 00:20:12.878
You truly are the most remarkable woman
in all of Joseon.

00:20:14.004 --> 00:20:15.964
That's enough flattery.

00:20:19.801 --> 00:20:25.766
Could even a flower in full bloom
be fairer than this virtuous lady?

00:20:26.808 --> 00:20:31.146
She was ever so serene
as she arrived in a white palanquin,

00:20:31.772 --> 00:20:36.818
clad in mourning robes even as her
wedding clothes had scarcely been worn.

00:20:38.195 --> 00:20:41.406
Seeing her mourn a husband
she had never known,

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:43.325
while devoting herself entirely

00:20:43.408 --> 00:20:46.578
to the cultivation of chastity
and filial piety,

00:20:46.662 --> 00:20:49.790
made my heart stir with pity many a time.

00:20:54.002 --> 00:20:55.045
My lady.

00:20:55.128 --> 00:20:57.297
Indeed, as a woman myself,

00:20:57.381 --> 00:21:00.092
I believe that it is only right
to honor her

00:21:00.175 --> 00:21:02.636
and make her virtue widely known.

00:21:03.387 --> 00:21:06.515
Thus, I humbly present this petition,

00:21:06.598 --> 00:21:09.768
though I am neither her kin
nor her in-law,

00:21:10.519 --> 00:21:13.855
so she may stand as an example
to all women.

00:21:17.442 --> 00:21:18.860
Did you compel her to do it?

00:21:18.944 --> 00:21:19.945
Compel it?

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:22.322
What… Whatever do you mean?

00:21:22.406 --> 00:21:26.118
That woman has asked the king to give
our daughter-in-law royal recognition!

00:21:26.201 --> 00:21:27.369
Ah…

00:21:29.204 --> 00:21:33.000
Can there be any doubt the poor girl
was a virtuous woman?

00:21:33.083 --> 00:21:34.876
All of Hanyang knows it.

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:38.255
If I thought there was anything
I could do to help, even a little,

00:21:38.338 --> 00:21:40.340
I would do it.

00:21:47.139 --> 00:21:49.433
I did not seek to benefit myself.

00:21:50.017 --> 00:21:51.935
I did it for our household.

00:21:53.353 --> 00:21:55.147
After we lost Geum-ho,

00:21:55.981 --> 00:21:57.524
what's left in this house

00:21:58.608 --> 00:22:00.902
worthy of the name family?

00:22:01.486 --> 00:22:02.696
My lady!

00:22:03.363 --> 00:22:06.325
With Geum-ho,
this house lost more than a son.

00:22:07.075 --> 00:22:08.702
It lost its pillar.

00:22:10.704 --> 00:22:11.955
Its foundation.

00:22:12.748 --> 00:22:15.459
If you will not take action,
my lord, I will.

00:22:15.542 --> 00:22:18.670
What other way is there
of easing Geum-ho's grievance?

00:22:18.754 --> 00:22:20.672
That grievance is your own.

00:22:21.381 --> 00:22:23.717
Now that Geum-ho is dead, he has none.

00:22:27.054 --> 00:22:28.889
We have not yet even found her body.

00:22:28.972 --> 00:22:30.390
Restrain yourself.

00:22:33.310 --> 00:22:34.603
Our Geum-ho…

00:22:36.480 --> 00:22:38.982
he appears to me when I'm dreaming.

00:22:40.859 --> 00:22:43.111
My son comes to me…

00:22:43.195 --> 00:22:45.614
…and cries his poor heart out.

00:22:46.698 --> 00:22:48.617
He does not speak a word.

00:22:49.951 --> 00:22:51.703
He just sits there and cries.

00:22:55.415 --> 00:22:57.501
At the very least,

00:22:58.085 --> 00:23:00.545
we can build her a Memorial Gate.

00:23:01.963 --> 00:23:04.549
That is the one thing I can do for him.

00:23:05.550 --> 00:23:07.636
The only way to help my son.

00:23:09.012 --> 00:23:10.013
My lady…

00:23:14.476 --> 00:23:16.686
Father, it is In-Ho.

00:23:31.368 --> 00:23:32.869
What's the matter?

00:23:32.953 --> 00:23:34.538
Has something happened?

00:23:36.498 --> 00:23:39.459
You're holding something. What is it?

00:23:51.138 --> 00:23:54.391
I was in her room. I found this book.

00:24:01.356 --> 00:24:05.610
INTRODUCTION TO
ESSENTIAL CATHOLIC TEACHINGS

00:24:09.573 --> 00:24:10.949
Catholic teachings.

00:24:11.825 --> 00:24:14.244
Huh?

00:24:16.037 --> 00:24:17.164
Oh!

00:24:27.340 --> 00:24:29.634
So you did not know
that my daughter-in-law

00:24:29.718 --> 00:24:31.219
was a follower of the Catholics?

00:24:31.303 --> 00:24:34.014
No, madam! I knew nothing about it!

00:24:34.556 --> 00:24:35.682
Well, Ganghwa.

00:24:35.765 --> 00:24:36.808
Yes, madam.

00:24:36.892 --> 00:24:41.104
I don't care if she never walks again.
Beat this wench until she opens her mouth.

00:24:41.605 --> 00:24:42.606
Yes, madam.

00:24:43.690 --> 00:24:46.902
Madam! Madam, I swear it's the truth.

00:24:46.985 --> 00:24:50.780
If I knew anything, I would surely tell.

00:24:52.741 --> 00:24:54.493
Then…

00:24:55.869 --> 00:24:57.662
I will change the question.

00:24:58.246 --> 00:25:00.790
What did you take
from my daughter-in-law's room?

00:25:01.416 --> 00:25:02.417
What?

00:25:03.919 --> 00:25:06.505
You will only be punished further
if you lie.

00:25:06.588 --> 00:25:07.797
Now tell me the truth.

00:25:11.843 --> 00:25:13.637
That… I can't…

00:25:15.138 --> 00:25:18.517
What's this? Are you hesitant to answer?

00:25:22.938 --> 00:25:24.314
I will tell you!

00:25:24.397 --> 00:25:25.565
I will tell you all!

00:25:26.149 --> 00:25:28.318
What I took was…

00:25:29.152 --> 00:25:30.612
the letters he sent…

00:25:32.906 --> 00:25:35.450
The letters Lord Cho Won sent to my lady.

00:25:35.992 --> 00:25:37.202
Cho Won?

00:25:37.786 --> 00:25:40.413
You're referring to
Minister Yoo's brother-in-law?

00:25:41.748 --> 00:25:42.999
He sent letters?

00:25:44.626 --> 00:25:45.669
Ganghwa.

00:25:46.253 --> 00:25:47.254
Yes, madam?

00:25:47.337 --> 00:25:49.464
Get all the switches you can find
and bring them here.

00:25:49.548 --> 00:25:52.008
I have a feeling
there's a lot more I need to hear

00:25:52.092 --> 00:25:53.718
from this wretched girl's mouth.

00:25:55.762 --> 00:25:57.013
Oh, dear.

00:26:05.146 --> 00:26:06.147
Oh, dear.

00:26:10.443 --> 00:26:13.113
Madam, I beg you to spare my life, please!

00:26:13.196 --> 00:26:15.323
I did not want to do it. No!

00:26:16.032 --> 00:26:17.200
I had no choice!

00:26:17.284 --> 00:26:20.203
The lady of Minister Yoo's house
bid me to do it.

00:26:21.413 --> 00:26:22.914
I swear, that is the truth!

00:26:22.998 --> 00:26:23.999
Who?

00:26:25.500 --> 00:26:26.876
Who put you up to it?

00:26:28.628 --> 00:26:29.796
The lady of…

00:26:31.673 --> 00:26:33.258
Minister Yoo's house.

00:26:52.402 --> 00:26:54.529
Don't you think he looks like someone?

00:26:55.322 --> 00:26:56.781
I'm not sure.

00:26:58.575 --> 00:27:01.244
Though it may bear a resemblance to…

00:27:01.745 --> 00:27:03.163
Lord Cho Won?

00:27:05.665 --> 00:27:07.250
That settles it.

00:27:07.334 --> 00:27:08.585
The plan worked.

00:27:08.668 --> 00:27:11.254
That painter was well worth what I paid.

00:27:15.634 --> 00:27:17.510
There was once a man

00:27:18.219 --> 00:27:22.223
who went about scolding womanhoods
with his large hands.

00:27:23.475 --> 00:27:28.021
It is said that there were many a woman
who wet their undergarments thanks to him.

00:27:28.813 --> 00:27:31.733
Was the man's plying really so pleasing?

00:27:33.026 --> 00:27:38.031
At that time, in Bukchon,
there lived a woman who went missing.

00:27:43.536 --> 00:27:47.290
Perhaps she is somewhere
sitting across from this man

00:27:47.374 --> 00:27:51.211
with her legs spread
and her breath coming quick and shallow.

00:27:55.298 --> 00:27:59.052
Where on earth is the young woman now?

00:28:01.179 --> 00:28:03.598
-The man must be depicted exactly.
-Yes, ma'am.

00:28:03.682 --> 00:28:06.017
Pay particular heed to the man.

00:28:06.101 --> 00:28:07.268
Yes, sir.

00:28:28.289 --> 00:28:30.417
Madam, where are you?

00:28:30.500 --> 00:28:31.710
I have news!

00:28:33.795 --> 00:28:37.048
It has spread not only to Bukchon,
but also to Jungchon and Namchon.

00:28:37.132 --> 00:28:41.052
I'm afraid to say it has prompted
the spread of strange rumors.

00:28:41.136 --> 00:28:43.471
The timing is most unfortunate.

00:28:43.555 --> 00:28:45.557
They say the councilor's
daughter-in-law is…

00:28:49.477 --> 00:28:51.062
There once was a man…

00:28:51.146 --> 00:28:52.480
"Come by when you get the chance."

00:28:52.564 --> 00:28:54.858
-…who went about scolding womanhoods…
-"And scold my womanhood"…

00:28:54.941 --> 00:28:57.777
-…with his large hands.
-…"with your large hands. I beg you."

00:29:04.451 --> 00:29:05.535
I mean…

00:29:05.618 --> 00:29:08.413
Heaven spare us,
it is positively scandalous.

00:29:18.256 --> 00:29:19.257
Madam.

00:29:21.760 --> 00:29:22.802
There you are.

00:29:22.886 --> 00:29:23.887
Yes, madam.

00:29:23.970 --> 00:29:25.180
I heard you called,

00:29:25.263 --> 00:29:27.557
-so I dropped everything to--
-It seems we are both busy,

00:29:27.640 --> 00:29:29.642
so let us come straight to the point.

00:29:32.771 --> 00:29:35.148
Why have you been spreading these rumors?

00:29:36.149 --> 00:29:37.609
Oh, um…

00:29:38.193 --> 00:29:39.402
What rumors?

00:29:39.486 --> 00:29:41.696
Do you have a grudge against my cousin?

00:29:44.073 --> 00:29:45.158
Or perhaps…

00:29:45.658 --> 00:29:47.285
the councilor's daughter-in-law?

00:29:48.828 --> 00:29:50.413
If it is neither of those,

00:29:51.289 --> 00:29:53.958
pray tell what I have done to wrong you
in any way?

00:29:54.542 --> 00:29:55.835
Oh, you wrong me?

00:29:55.919 --> 00:29:57.462
No, madam, you could never.

00:29:57.545 --> 00:29:58.880
Then what is it?

00:29:59.672 --> 00:30:01.591
For what reason have you done it?

00:30:02.175 --> 00:30:05.678
Tell me, is there something you seek
from me perhaps?

00:30:10.058 --> 00:30:11.142
Madam.

00:30:12.227 --> 00:30:14.229
There is nothing more from you I desire.

00:30:14.771 --> 00:30:18.274
My only wish from the beginning
was for my dear So-ok

00:30:18.358 --> 00:30:21.277
to live as this house's
honorable concubine.

00:30:22.028 --> 00:30:26.658
But if Lord Cho Won's visiting her room
be grounds for her being cast out,

00:30:26.741 --> 00:30:29.077
how could her mother not be torn apart?

00:30:29.619 --> 00:30:34.207
So, madam, all I would ask of you
is for your solemn promise

00:30:34.749 --> 00:30:39.254
that So-ok will live her days as
a cherished member of this house forever.

00:30:40.255 --> 00:30:41.256
I beg of you.

00:30:44.092 --> 00:30:45.760
So you're threatening me now?

00:30:45.844 --> 00:30:47.387
The likes of you…

00:30:47.470 --> 00:30:50.348
Ganghwa! The palanquin is ready!

00:31:07.031 --> 00:31:08.491
You have a merchant's spirit.

00:31:08.575 --> 00:31:10.368
I grant your actions were bold.

00:31:10.451 --> 00:31:12.829
Gather everything you have circulated.

00:31:12.912 --> 00:31:14.539
It must not spread beyond the gates.

00:31:14.622 --> 00:31:19.294
Yes. I will gather every single one.
I will stop them without fail.

00:31:19.377 --> 00:31:21.921
Make no more sound. Leave quietly.

00:31:22.630 --> 00:31:23.756
Yes, madam.

00:31:30.972 --> 00:31:32.181
Hurry. Let us go.

00:31:53.745 --> 00:31:54.996
Did you notice

00:31:56.122 --> 00:31:59.083
an interesting paper
circulating in Bukchon?

00:31:59.876 --> 00:32:03.004
The depicted in the drawing
and so described

00:32:03.713 --> 00:32:06.132
certainly does look familiar.

00:32:11.471 --> 00:32:14.098
I hope you don't think I'm troubled by it.

00:32:15.183 --> 00:32:17.143
After all, did you not yourself,

00:32:17.727 --> 00:32:20.772
some time ago,
make your cousin's faults known?

00:32:22.106 --> 00:32:27.362
What use is there now in retracing
where and what faults he committed…

00:32:28.404 --> 00:32:32.992
…or the shame he has brought to my house?

00:32:36.287 --> 00:32:37.413
Ah.

00:32:38.081 --> 00:32:39.082
I should say

00:32:39.165 --> 00:32:43.544
how displeased I am that you knew
something yet persisted in deceiving me.

00:32:43.628 --> 00:32:46.714
But I need not hear your explanations,
only this…

00:32:48.716 --> 00:32:53.554
Make sure the things Eun-sil gave you
are handled with discretion.

00:32:54.889 --> 00:32:59.894
Furthermore, I still need approval
for Hui-yeon's Memorial Gate.

00:33:01.312 --> 00:33:04.273
If you wouldn't mind lending
a bit more effort,

00:33:05.775 --> 00:33:07.443
that would be very nice.

00:33:12.156 --> 00:33:14.534
Am I asking for too much?

00:33:16.828 --> 00:33:17.996
Certainly not.

00:33:23.835 --> 00:33:25.169
This little room

00:33:26.087 --> 00:33:28.381
is a most interesting place.

00:33:43.730 --> 00:33:45.440
It doesn't hurt?

00:33:49.610 --> 00:33:52.113
Look there. That's your madam, isn't it?

00:33:52.196 --> 00:33:53.614
Move closer to the side.

00:33:54.741 --> 00:33:56.868
It's barely four steps from the house,

00:33:56.951 --> 00:33:59.328
yet she insists on taking
the palanquin everywhere.

00:33:59.954 --> 00:34:02.165
Gently!

00:34:02.248 --> 00:34:03.791
Didn't I tell you to move gently?

00:34:03.875 --> 00:34:06.252
Oh. Sorry. Did that hurt?

00:34:07.003 --> 00:34:08.504
Why wouldn't it hurt?

00:34:08.588 --> 00:34:11.424
It feels like my calves
are being torn apart.

00:34:11.507 --> 00:34:12.550
All right.

00:34:12.633 --> 00:34:15.928
Then I shall slither along like a snake.

00:34:16.012 --> 00:34:18.306
You won't feel a thing, huh?

00:34:18.389 --> 00:34:19.766
Slither.

00:34:19.849 --> 00:34:22.852
Hurry up. I'll get scolded if I'm late.

00:34:22.935 --> 00:34:24.187
As you wish.

00:34:24.270 --> 00:34:26.064
Silk for sale! Come buy my silk!

00:34:26.147 --> 00:34:29.609
-Slither, slither like this.
-No better silk in town.

00:34:30.610 --> 00:34:34.906
Why has there been no word
from one who said he would come shortly?

00:34:35.531 --> 00:34:39.410
There is something I must tell you,
so I would ask that you make haste.

00:34:39.494 --> 00:34:41.746
My lord, with your leave, I shall enter.

00:34:59.514 --> 00:35:00.515
Uh…

00:35:17.865 --> 00:35:18.866
Oh.

00:35:27.792 --> 00:35:30.044
Did you make all of this yourself?

00:35:30.128 --> 00:35:32.380
I made them with Asan.

00:35:54.819 --> 00:35:56.404
I have an idea. Here.

00:35:56.487 --> 00:35:58.698
Like this. Hmm?

00:35:58.781 --> 00:35:59.866
How's that?

00:35:59.949 --> 00:36:01.617
Why don't we go like this?

00:36:02.243 --> 00:36:03.911
I cannot see a thing.

00:36:05.246 --> 00:36:07.123
Ah. Like this, then.

00:36:10.126 --> 00:36:13.129
The things you are about to see,
you will never see again.

00:36:13.212 --> 00:36:15.047
For today is no ordinary day.

00:36:15.673 --> 00:36:17.592
We have many places to be.

00:36:20.052 --> 00:36:21.637
Let us go out like this.

00:36:22.180 --> 00:36:23.181
Like this.

00:36:26.809 --> 00:36:28.436
Come in and peruse my wares!

00:36:28.519 --> 00:36:30.646
Yeot, yeot! Get your yeot here!

00:36:31.230 --> 00:36:33.941
Oh, my gracious lord,
come have a look at the yeot.

00:36:34.025 --> 00:36:37.361
Oh, yes, indeed.
The sweetest yeot you'll find.

00:36:39.697 --> 00:36:42.074
My word, you look so beautiful, my lady.

00:36:42.575 --> 00:36:43.826
My lady.

00:37:13.272 --> 00:37:15.024
It is very slippery here.

00:37:15.107 --> 00:37:16.984
Come. Let's try like this.

00:41:55.471 --> 00:41:57.765
Someday, we may find ourselves…

00:41:59.308 --> 00:42:01.352
looking back upon tonight.

00:42:03.604 --> 00:42:06.774
I fear that with time,
this memory shall grow faint.

00:42:13.781 --> 00:42:15.407
I am terribly afraid.

00:42:17.201 --> 00:42:19.286
So are you a coward then?

00:42:49.191 --> 00:42:52.278
What has made you become sad
all of a sudden?

00:42:55.364 --> 00:42:57.283
I am merely so happy…

00:43:00.786 --> 00:43:02.246
that I'm almost…

00:43:05.749 --> 00:43:07.585
starting to feel unsettled.

00:43:45.289 --> 00:43:47.541
I would engrave you if I could, my lord.

00:43:51.795 --> 00:43:54.340
I want to show you
what tonight has meant to me.

00:43:56.925 --> 00:43:58.552
Will you accept it of me?

00:44:02.473 --> 00:44:04.433
Engrave as deep as you can.

00:44:06.310 --> 00:44:08.228
There's nothing I'd desire more.

00:44:23.619 --> 00:44:26.705
Have you truly been summoned
to see His Majesty?

00:44:26.789 --> 00:44:29.166
What? Is it so hard to believe?

00:44:29.750 --> 00:44:30.959
Not at all. But…

00:44:31.752 --> 00:44:32.961
it's just…

00:44:33.587 --> 00:44:36.507
I feel there is much
I do not know about you.

00:44:38.509 --> 00:44:40.344
I shall return before you go to bed.

00:44:40.427 --> 00:44:41.804
All will be well.

00:44:45.099 --> 00:44:48.143
Uh, we decided to work together.

00:44:49.645 --> 00:44:52.481
I-I thought it would be safer
to follow her

00:44:53.232 --> 00:44:55.150
than to spend the day on my own.

00:44:56.193 --> 00:44:59.571
Now, when you say work,
surely you don't mean hard labor?

00:44:59.655 --> 00:45:01.240
It will be all right.

00:45:02.741 --> 00:45:04.827
All will be well, just as you said.

00:45:04.910 --> 00:45:07.329
-But still, are-are you sure…
-Don't worry.

00:45:07.413 --> 00:45:09.206
I will stay close by her side.

00:45:09.289 --> 00:45:10.708
She won't tire herself.

00:45:10.791 --> 00:45:13.377
Hurry and be on your way, young master.

00:45:16.964 --> 00:45:19.967
Goodness, if you are to return
before she goes to bed,

00:45:20.050 --> 00:45:21.176
you must hurry.

00:45:35.065 --> 00:45:36.567
Oh. My lord!

00:45:47.745 --> 00:45:49.371
Uh… Well…

00:46:06.388 --> 00:46:09.349
I have engraved my heart into every word,

00:46:09.933 --> 00:46:12.728
so please keep it deep, deep within yours.

00:46:15.564 --> 00:46:17.232
Then, my dear cousin.

00:46:18.984 --> 00:46:22.946
Can you provide the sounds
of that young widow opening herself to you

00:46:24.323 --> 00:46:26.408
after decades with untarnished virtue

00:46:26.909 --> 00:46:29.828
in a mature piece of heartfelt writing?

00:46:56.021 --> 00:46:57.648
I shall return soon.

00:47:49.741 --> 00:47:50.742
Good grief.

00:48:03.005 --> 00:48:04.798
I was cutting it like this, you see.

00:48:04.882 --> 00:48:06.425
But then I realized

00:48:06.508 --> 00:48:10.637
I had not the strength for it,
and ended up falling on my bottom.

00:48:22.649 --> 00:48:24.109
You have come just in time.

00:48:26.778 --> 00:48:29.072
Your Majesty, it is your servant, Cho Won.

00:48:29.156 --> 00:48:31.074
I have come from Hwaseong as you command.

00:48:31.158 --> 00:48:34.620
I have well received your reply
to my confidential orders.

00:48:35.120 --> 00:48:38.832
Indeed, construction appears
to be progressing swiftly.

00:48:39.416 --> 00:48:40.542
It does, Your Majesty.

00:48:40.626 --> 00:48:44.922
In particular, I noticed the artisans
have increased their efficiency.

00:48:45.005 --> 00:48:48.300
I would surmise the reason is
their wages are being adjusted

00:48:48.383 --> 00:48:49.760
according to their abilities.

00:48:49.843 --> 00:48:51.386
They seem to take pride in that alone.

00:48:51.470 --> 00:48:53.096
And it may also serve

00:48:53.180 --> 00:48:56.475
to motivate the lower-ranking artisans
to strive even harder.

00:48:56.558 --> 00:48:57.559
Yes.

00:48:58.852 --> 00:49:02.147
I believe construction will be completed
several years earlier

00:49:02.230 --> 00:49:04.358
than what you had previously planned.

00:49:05.192 --> 00:49:08.236
Provided the high-ranking officials
cause no trouble.

00:49:08.820 --> 00:49:10.364
Good.

00:49:10.447 --> 00:49:13.533
I have other matters to attend to,
which is why I summoned you here in haste.

00:49:21.959 --> 00:49:26.588
The councilor's daughter-in-law seems
to have gone back to her home for good.

00:49:28.048 --> 00:49:30.509
Where she breathed her last,
it is not known,

00:49:30.592 --> 00:49:32.511
for they could not find her body.

00:49:33.220 --> 00:49:35.263
I wish to commend her filial piety,

00:49:35.347 --> 00:49:38.141
but he insists that he must see the body.

00:49:38.725 --> 00:49:41.228
How can I prevail
against such stubbornness?

00:49:42.145 --> 00:49:45.941
I hear that her hometown lies
near the construction site of Hwaseong.

00:49:46.984 --> 00:49:49.403
Could you join the search for her body?

00:49:59.579 --> 00:50:01.832
I shall obey Your Majesty's command.

00:50:11.591 --> 00:50:12.718
My goodness.

00:50:18.015 --> 00:50:19.057
Go on in, miss.

00:50:19.808 --> 00:50:21.393
Go have something to drink.

00:50:22.185 --> 00:50:24.438
All right? Go on, go on.

00:50:49.463 --> 00:50:52.090
All right. I will be back shortly.

00:50:52.174 --> 00:50:53.175
Yes, yes.

00:50:58.972 --> 00:51:00.140
Goodness, it's hot.

00:51:05.979 --> 00:51:07.105
A little more…

00:51:21.495 --> 00:51:23.580
A bountiful harvest this year!

00:51:23.663 --> 00:51:26.041
Goodness,
these ripened splendidly, didn't they?

00:51:26.124 --> 00:51:27.375
They have indeed.

00:51:27.459 --> 00:51:29.211
Sister-in-law!

00:51:29.294 --> 00:51:31.630
Sister-in-law!

00:51:34.508 --> 00:51:35.634
Sister-in-law.

00:51:39.513 --> 00:51:41.848
Sister-in-law. It's In-ho.

00:51:43.308 --> 00:51:44.684
So you live after all?

00:51:59.533 --> 00:52:00.700
Brother-in-law.

00:52:01.535 --> 00:52:02.536
How come?

00:52:04.204 --> 00:52:05.497
How come you're here?

00:52:16.341 --> 00:52:18.051
I came to see Master Cho Won.

00:52:20.137 --> 00:52:22.514
But if you are here like this,
it must mean…

00:52:26.685 --> 00:52:28.937
-I know how it seems.
-Hyah! Hyah!

00:52:29.020 --> 00:52:30.021
Brother-in-law.

00:52:30.730 --> 00:52:31.731
Brother-in-law!

00:52:36.278 --> 00:52:37.279
Hyah.

00:52:44.202 --> 00:52:45.370
-Ah.
-Lady So.

00:52:45.453 --> 00:52:47.205
What brings you here at this hour?

00:52:47.289 --> 00:52:49.541
Madam, have you heard yet?

00:52:50.584 --> 00:52:52.544
About the councilor's daughter-in-law.

00:52:53.128 --> 00:52:56.631
They are saying
that the girl's body hasn't been found.

00:53:02.012 --> 00:53:03.889
My husband may not be of much use,

00:53:03.972 --> 00:53:06.474
but he is still quick with the news.

00:53:07.767 --> 00:53:09.811
Today, at His Majesty's court,

00:53:10.812 --> 00:53:13.148
the king commanded her body be retrieved.

00:53:13.231 --> 00:53:15.025
And he entrusted this task

00:53:16.234 --> 00:53:20.030
to your own dear cousin,
Lord Cho Won, himself.

00:54:12.749 --> 00:54:14.542
Why are you still waiting outside?

00:54:15.126 --> 00:54:16.378
Young master.

00:54:17.379 --> 00:54:18.630
You are quite late.